# Normalize text to LF on checkout.
#
# Why: the committed blobs (including dist/) are LF, but a Windows checkout
# with core.autocrlf=true materializes CRLF working files. Rebuilding dist/
# from those then produces a CRLF dist/index.js.map, and CI's dist-fresh
# check (Linux, LF) fails on the phantom diff. Seen twice while landing
# #84 and #85. text=auto leaves detected binaries untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf
